# Everything in here is a clone made by pull.sh. Ignore all of it, and keep only
# the files that describe how to get it back — plus go.mod, which keeps the
# clones out of the ASS build (see the comment in it).
#
# A wildcard rather than a list of directory names, so adding a repository means
# editing pull.sh alone and never this file.
*
!.gitignore
!go.mod
!pull.sh
!README.md
